@@s079 I look at the type after the colon in the signature: <code>Option[A]</code> → <code>None</code>, <code>LazyList[A]</code> → <code>empty</code>, <code>List[A]</code> → <code>Nil</code>. In <code>unfold</code> both appear: your function says <code>None</code> ("there is no other element") and <code>unfold</code> translates it into <code>empty</code>.
